  "description": "The user is projected onto the text_chunk 'islamic warrior's funeral in palestine', which frames the visual material as a ritualistic event associated with violence and extremism. The text acts as a deictic label that directs the user's interpretation of the visual scene, imposing a hateful stereotype onto the image. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you', but the text functions as an implicit projection by commanding the viewer to interpret the visual material through the lens of the stereotype it provides.",
